@jkj Apologies if I was not clear during the call.

My recollection is that I don't think you should use systemd; however, because I didn't know how you intended to use systemd and if you felt strongly you had found a novel approach, you could propose it in your design document.

After looking over the approach you have proposed, I do think it violates the challenge requirements: "The server should also not rely on any shell scripts, external binaries or use containers to execute jobs."
